<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ikon Office downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ikon Office downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Ikon Office Solutions Inc to hold from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- late Thursday the company said its net earnings for the fiscal third and fourth quarters would be below analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>-- the stock fell 2-5/8 to 23-3/8.</p>
</text>
